## 🎯 1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY & PROJECT VISION

### 🟧 1.1 Project Overview
**Zaika** is an end-to-end, full-stack restaurant operations and smart dining management platform. It replaces manual paper order pads, static printed menus, and disconnected billing counters with a unified, real-time digital ecosystem connecting **diners**, **floor staff**, **kitchen stations**, and **restaurant owners**.

### 🟩 1.2 Core Problems Solved
* 🟢 **Zero-Wait QR Ordering:** Eliminates customer wait times for physical menus and order taking via instant table QR scanning—no app downloads or sign-ups required.
* 🟠 **Kitchen Bottleneck Prevention:** Routes dishes automatically to a station-split **Kitchen Display System (KDS)** with colour-coded urgency timers (`🟢 New`, `🟡 Cooking Long`, `🔴 Late`).
* 🔴 **Instant Digital Waiter Alerts:** Replaces hand-waving with one-tap **Call Waiter** alerts that flash the requesting table red and measure staff response speed in seconds.
* 🟣 **Smart Split Billing & Checkout:** Simplifies group dining with automated itemized invoices, 5% GST calculation, tip presets, and equal or per-item bill splitting.
* 🔵 **Live Owner Business Intelligence:** Equips owners with real-time revenue KPIs, top-selling dish charts, staff SLA metrics, and one-click menu availability toggles.

