## 🏗️ 2. SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & TECHNOLOGY STACK

### 🟦 2.1 Three-Tier Full-Stack Architecture

| Architecture Layer | Technologies Used | Core Responsibilities |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 🎨 **Presentation Layer (Frontend)** | `Streamlit`, `Plotly`, `Requests`, `QRCode` | Delivers 4 role-specific interfaces (Customer QR Menu, Staff Tablet, KDS Board, Owner Dashboard) with live charts and session state. |
| ⚡ **Application Layer (Backend)** | `FastAPI`, `Uvicorn`, `Pydantic` | Exposes 24 REST API endpoints, validates all incoming JSON payloads, enforces business rules, and serves Swagger UI at `/docs`. |
| 🔐 **Security & Auth Layer** | `JWT (python-jose)`, `Passlib (bcrypt)` | Secures Staff, Kitchen, and Owner endpoints via 8-hour Bearer tokens while validating token-free customer QR links. |
| 🔗 **ORM Mapping Layer** | `SQLAlchemy ORM` | Translates Python domain classes into parameterized SQL queries and manages atomic multi-table database transactions. |
| 🗄️ **Primary Database** | `MySQL 8.0+ (pymysql)` | Stores all **10 core relational tables** with strict Primary/Foreign Key constraints, ENUM states, and 3NF normalization. |
| 📝 **Secondary Audit Store** | `SQLite (audit_logs.db)` | Captures rapid operational audit events (`USER_LOGIN`, `ORDER_PLACED`, `BILL_PAID`) locally without adding load to MySQL. |
| 🐳 **Testing & DevOps** | `Pytest`, `TestClient`, `Docker Compose` | Runs automated validation/security tests and orchestrates MySQL, FastAPI, and Streamlit in isolated containers. |

### 🔀 2.2 End-to-End Data Journey
> `📱 Streamlit UI Click` ➔ `📦 JSON Payload (Requests + JWT)` ➔ `⚡ FastAPI Router & RBAC Guard` ➔ `🛡️ Pydantic Validation` ➔ `🔗 SQLAlchemy ORM` ➔ `🗄️ MySQL (Core Data) + 📝 SQLite (Audit Log)` ➔ `✅ JSON Response` ➔ `🔄 Live UI Refresh`

