## 🧩 4. DETAILED FUNCTIONAL SPECIFICATIONS (10 MODULES)

### 🟧 Module 1: Table & Floor Management
* **Live 6-Table Grid:** Visual floor plan covering **`T1`, `T2`, `T3`, `T4`, `T5`, and `T6`** with an active occupancy counter (`6/6 Tables Active`).
* **5 Colour-Coded Table Statuses:**
  * ⚪ **`Empty`** — Clean and ready for new guests.
  * 🔵 **`Ordering`** — Customer scanned QR code and is browsing/ordering.
  * 🟠 **`Eating`** — Order sent to kitchen or served at table.
  * 🟣 **`Bill Requested`** — Guest initiated checkout and awaits payment.
  * 🔴 **`Needs Help`** — Active Call Waiter alert triggered (flashes red on staff map).
* **QR Security Tokens:** Each table URL embeds a unique secret token (`?table=T1&token=tok_t1_99a1`) to prevent prank orders from outside the restaurant.

### 🟩 Module 2: Contactless Customer QR Menu & Ordering
* **Instant Mobile Menu:** Opens immediately upon scanning QR—zero app installation or registration.
* **4 Structured Categories:** `Main Course` • `Sides` • `Drinks` • `Deals`.
* **Rich Dish Cards:** Displays Dish Name, Photo, `Half` & `Full` prices, `🟢 Veg` / `🔴 Non-Veg` badges, Spice Level (`Mild`, `Medium`, `Hot`), Allergen tags (`Dairy`, `Nuts`, `Gluten`), and promotional badges (`🔥 Deal of the Day`).
* **Smart Filtering & Cart:** Filter by category, Veg-only toggle, allergen exclusion, or live keyword search; add customized items to cart with `+/-` quantity controls.

### 🔵 Module 3: Two-Step Order Flow & Live Tracking
* **Two-Step Dispatch:** Customer places order (`🟡 Placed`) ➔ Appears on Staff Tablet ➔ Staff clicks **Send to Kitchen** (`🟠 Confirmed` / `🟠 Cooking`).
* **Visual Status Bar:** Real-time progress steps: `Placed` ➔ `Confirmed` ➔ `Cooking` ➔ `Ready` ➔ `Served`.
* **Live Cooking Countdown:** Dynamically calculates remaining minutes and seconds from `estimated_ready_at` (e.g., *"⏱️ Your food is cooking — 11:30 min left"*).

### 🔴 Module 4: Kitchen Display System (KDS)
* **3 Specialized Station Columns:** Automatically splits order items into **🔥 Tandoor**, **🍛 Curry**, and **🥤 Drinks**.
* **Colour-Coded Urgency Timers:**
  * 🟢 **Green (`0–5 mins`):** Freshly received ticket.
  * 🟡 **Yellow (`5–12 mins`):** Cooking for an extended duration.
  * 🔴 **Red (`> 12 mins`):** Late / overdue priority alert.
* **Station Workflow:** Kitchen staff tap **Start Cooking** ➔ **Mark Ready**. Cards automatically clear from the KDS board once floor staff mark the order **Served**.

### 🟣 Module 5: Guest Engagement Suite (While Waiting)
* 📶 **Free WiFi Unlock Card:** Automatically reveals WiFi Network Name and Password immediately after placing an order.
* 🎁 **Loyalty Rewards Bar:** Tracks guest points (`160 / 200 pts`) with a live progress bar toward unlocking **`200 points = Free Mango Lassi`**.
* 🌶️ **Interactive Spice Quiz:** Culinary trivia mini-game awarding bonus points for correct answers.
* 🏆 **Table vs. Table Challenge:** Live points leaderboard (`T5 vs T2 Live Leaderboard`) gamifying friendly competition between tables.

### 🚨 Module 6: Call Waiter Alert System
* **One-Tap Assistance:** Customer selects **`💧 Water`**, **`🧻 Napkins`**, **`🧾 Bill`**, or **`🙋 Other Help`**.
* **Instant Staff Popup & SLA Timer:** Highlights the table red on the Staff Floor Map (`🔴 T5 Needs Help — Water`). Tapping **Mark Resolved** calculates exact response speed in seconds (e.g., *"⚡ Waiter Reached in 8 sec"*).

### 💳 Module 7: Billing, Split Calculator & Payment Settlement
* **Consolidated Itemized Invoice:** Combines all active table orders with **Subtotal**, **5% GST**, **Tip**, and **Grand Total**.
* **Flexible Bill Splitting:** Choose **Single Payment**, **Equal Split (`2, 3, or 4 people`)**, or **Split by Individual Item**.
* **Tip Presets & 5 Payment Channels:** Tip `5%`, `10%`, `15%`, or Custom ₹; pay via `💵 Cash`, `💳 Card`, `🏦 Bank Transfer`, `📱 Google Pay`, or `🍎 Apple Pay`.
• Automated Table Reset: Marks bill Paid, closes all table orders, displays digital receipt, and resets table status to ⚪ Empty.

⭐ Module 8: Post-Payment Feedback & Review

• Prompts diners immediately after checkout ("How was your experience?") with a 1.0 to 5.0 ⭐ Star Rating and comment box that updates the Owner Dashboard live.

📊 Module 9: Owner Dashboard & Administrative Controls

• Live KPI Metrics: Active Tables (6/6), Total Orders Today, Total Revenue Today (₹), and Average Rating (⭐).
• Interactive Plotly Charts: Hourly Live Sales trend line and Top-Selling Dishes bar chart.
• Staff SLA & Management: Waiter response-speed leaderboard, Menu CRUD manager (with instant On/Off availability switches), and Staff/Kitchen/Owner user role controls.

📝 Module 10: Operational Audit Logging

• Automatically writes tamper-evident event trails (USER_LOGIN, ORDER_PLACED, ORDER_CONFIRMED, KDS_READY, ALERT_RESOLVED, BILL_PAID) to the local SQLite database.

🗄️ 5. RELATIONAL DATABASE DESIGN (10 MYSQL + 1 SQLITE TABLE)


🟦 5.1 Primary MySQL Schema (zaika_db — 3NF Normalized)


#	Table Name	Primary & Foreign Keys	Key Columns & Constraints	Purpose
1	users	PK: id	full_name, email (UNIQUE), password_hash, role (ENUM), is_active	Staff, Kitchen, and Owner login accounts.
2	restaurant_tables	PK: id	table_number (T1–T6), capacity, qr_token (UNIQUE), status (ENUM), current_points	Live floor map state, QR tokens & table challenge points.
3	menu_items	PK: id	name, category (ENUM), kitchen_station (ENUM), price_half, price_full, is_veg, allergens, deal_badge, prep_time_mins, is_available	Dishes, dietary metadata, prep timers & KDS station routing.
4	orders	PK: id
FK: table_id, confirmed_by	status (Placed..Closed), placed_at, cooking_started_at, estimated_ready_at	Customer order batches & live countdown timestamps.
5	order_items	PK: id
FK: order_id (CASCADE), menu_item_id	quantity (>=1), portion_size (Half/Full), spice_choice, unit_price, item_status	Line items linking orders to dishes with price snapshot.
6	bills	PK: id
FK: table_id	subtotal, gst_amount, tip_amount, grand_total, split_type, bill_status	Consolidated table invoices, GST, tips & split modes.
7	payments	PK: id
FK: bill_id	amount_paid, payment_method (5 options), customer_email, paid_at	Full or multi-transaction split payment records.
8	call_waiter_requests	PK: id
FK: table_id, resolved_by	request_type (4 options), status, created_at, resolved_at, response_seconds	Live waiter assistance alerts & SLA response speed.
9	reviews	PK: id
FK: table_id, bill_id	rating (1.0–5.0), comment, created_at	Post-payment customer star ratings & feedback.
10	rewards	PK: id
FK: table_id	guest_session_id (UNIQUE), points_balance, quiz_score, free_item_unlocked	Loyalty points (200 pts = Free Mango Lassi) & quiz scores.


🟨 5.2 Secondary SQLite Audit Table (audit_logs.db)


#	Table Name	Key Columns	Purpose
11	activity_logs	id (PK), actor_role, actor_id, action, details, timestamp	Lightweight local operational audit log.


🌐 6. REST API ENDPOINT CONTRACT (24 ENDPOINTS)


Domain	Method & Endpoint	Access	Functional Description
Auth	POST /api/auth/login	🟢 Public	Authenticates Staff/Kitchen/Owner and issues JWT Bearer token.
Auth	POST /api/auth/register	🟣 Owner	Creates new Staff, Kitchen, or Owner accounts.
Auth	GET /api/auth/users	🟣 Owner	Lists all staff accounts and active statuses.
Auth	PATCH /api/auth/users/{id}/toggle	🟣 Owner	Activates or deactivates a user account.
Tables	GET /api/tables	🔵 Staff / 🟣 Owner	Fetches live statuses and points for tables T1–T6.
Tables	GET /api/tables/verify-qr	🟢 Public	Validates table and token query parameters from QR scan.
Tables	PATCH /api/tables/{id}/status	🔵 Staff / 🟣 Owner	Manually updates table floor status.
Menu	GET /api/menu	🟢 Public	Lists available menu items with category, veg, allergen & search filters.
Menu	POST /api/menu	🟣 Owner	Adds a new dish to the menu.
Menu	PATCH /api/menu/{id}	🟣 Owner	Edits dish pricing, station, deal badge, or availability toggle.
Menu	DELETE /api/menu/{id}	🟣 Owner	Removes a dish from the menu.
Orders	POST /api/orders	🟢 Public	Places customer QR order (Placed), sets table Ordering, awards points.
Orders	GET /api/orders/table/{id}	🟢 Public	Fetches active orders & live countdown seconds for a table.
Orders	PATCH /api/orders/{id}/confirm	🔵 Staff / 🟣 Owner	Confirms order (Send to Kitchen) and sets estimated_ready_at.
KDS	GET /api/kds/active	🟠 Kitchen / 🟣 Owner	Returns active tickets grouped by Tandoor, Curry, and Drinks.
KDS	PATCH /api/kds/items/{id}/status	🟠 Kitchen / 🟣 Owner	Advances item status (Cooking ➔ Ready).
Orders	PATCH /api/orders/{id}/served	🔵 Staff / 🟣 Owner	Marks order Served and clears it from the KDS board.
Alerts	POST /api/alerts	🟢 Public	Triggers Call Waiter alert and highlights table Needs Help.
Alerts	GET /api/alerts/pending	🔵 Staff / 🟣 Owner	Fetches all unresolved Call Waiter alerts.
Alerts	PATCH /api/alerts/{id}/resolve	🔵 Staff / 🟣 Owner	Resolves alert and records response_seconds SLA metric.
Billing	POST /api/bills/generate/{id}	🟢 Public / 🔵 Staff	Computes subtotal, 5% GST, tip, and split breakdown.
Billing	POST /api/payments	🟢 Public / 🔵 Staff	Records payment; closes orders & resets table to Empty when paid.
Reviews	POST /api/reviews	🟢 Public	Saves post-payment 1.0–5.0 ⭐ rating and comment.
Analytics	GET /api/engagement/{id} & POST /api/engagement/quiz-submit & GET /api/analytics/summary	🟢 Public / 🟣 Owner	Serves WiFi/Rewards/Leaderboard, awards quiz points, and returns Owner KPIs, Plotly sales data & waiter SLA metrics.


