✅ 8. QUALITY ASSURANCE & DEPLOYMENT PLAN

• 🧪 Automated Validation Testing (Pytest): Verifies 200/201 happy paths, rejects negative quantities and out-of-range star ratings with 422 Unprocessable Entity, and blocks unauthorized access with 401/403 errors.
• 🐳 One-Command Containerized Launch (Docker Compose): Runs mysql_db (with healthcheck), zaika_backend (port 8000), and zaika_frontend (port 8501) seamlessly via docker-compose up --build -d.
